# SwiftPM build products and resolved dependency graph.
#
# `.build/` is regenerated by every `swift build`; committing it would add
# hundreds of megabytes that no reader ever looks at.
#
# `Package.resolved` is deliberately ignored too: this is an executable a user
# runs on their own Mac, not a library others link against, and the SemVer
# ranges in Package.swift are the intended contract. Pinning here would freeze
# security fixes in the NIO stack behind a manual bump.
.build/
Package.resolved
.swiftpm/
